      "text": "At ₹3,180 (NSE close, 12 Nov 2026), the reinvestment-phase discounted cash flow model (Template B, since TRENT's median return on invested capital of 29.6% is above its 13.97% cost of capital) does not reach the price at any revenue growth up to 60% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 11.5%; with revenue growing at its FY23–FY26 rate of 34.5%, it does at an operating margin of 27.6%.",
